OL,3,GNEWSARaheem Sterling given suspended
OL,4,Ajail sentence for dangerous driving and
OL,5,Anitrous oxide possession
OL,6,
OL,7,FEyewitnesses reported seeing the driver
OL,8,Fof a Lamborghini swerving and inhaling
OL,9,Ffrom a white balloon, with District
OL,10,FJudge Kirsty Allman describing the
OL,11,Ffootballer's actions as "deliberate and
OL,12,Fentirely selfish"
OL,14,FSterling - who doesn't currently belong
OL,15,Fto a club - has 82 England caps, the
OL,16,Flast of which was won at the 2022 World
OL,17,FCup
